; --inject: a tag on a posting injects once for every posting that carries
; it, even twice within one transaction; a tag on the transaction injects
; once per transaction, whatever the number of its postings.  A posting
; that carries the tag itself never consults the transaction's tag, so in
; "Both levels" Food injects its own $0.75 and the transaction's $2.00 is
; injected once, at the first posting without the tag (Drink).

2024/01/01 Two tagged postings
    Expenses:Food          $50.00
      ; Surcharge: $3.50
    Expenses:Drink         $20.00
      ; Surcharge: $1.25
    Assets:Checking

2024/01/02 Transaction tag
    ; Surcharge: $2.00
    Expenses:Food          $10.00
    Expenses:Drink          $5.00
    Assets:Checking

2024/01/03 Both levels
    ; Surcharge: $2.00
    Expenses:Food          $10.00
      ; Surcharge: $0.75
    Expenses:Drink          $5.00
    Expenses:Snack          $1.00
    Assets:Checking

test --inject Surcharge reg
24-Jan-01 Two tagged postings   Surcharge                     $3.50        $3.50
24-Jan-01 Two tagged postings   Expenses:Food                $50.00       $53.50
24-Jan-01 Two tagged postings   Surcharge                     $1.25       $54.75
24-Jan-01 Two tagged postings   Expenses:Drink               $20.00       $74.75
                                Assets:Checking             $-70.00        $4.75
24-Jan-02 Transaction tag       Surcharge                     $2.00        $6.75
24-Jan-02 Transaction tag       Expenses:Food                $10.00       $16.75
                                Expenses:Drink                $5.00       $21.75
                                Assets:Checking             $-15.00        $6.75
24-Jan-03 Both levels           Surcharge                     $0.75        $7.50
24-Jan-03 Both levels           Expenses:Food                $10.00       $17.50
24-Jan-03 Both levels           Surcharge                     $2.00       $19.50
24-Jan-03 Both levels           Expenses:Drink                $5.00       $24.50
                                Expenses:Snack                $1.00       $25.50
                                Assets:Checking             $-16.00        $9.50
end test
